{
    "background_story": "Haley was a thrill-seeking adventurer with a passion for living life on the edge. As a professional rock climber, she spent her days scaling vertical cliffs and pushing her limits. Haley's friends and family often referred to her as an 'edger' due to her fearless approach to the unknown. She had a knack for finding the most challenging routes and conquering them with ease. Haley's biggest achievement was being the first woman to free solo a notorious route in Yosemite National Park. Her daring feat earned her international recognition and cemented her reputation as one of the world's top climbers. Despite the risks, Haley wouldn't have it any other way, always chasing the next adrenaline rush and living life on her own terms.",
